@startuml state-access-request
' Title: SM-01 Access request lifecycle (PlantUML version of state-access-request.mmd, keep both in sync)
' Source: enums/RequestStatus.java, service/AccessRequestService.java, repository/AccessRequestRepository.java
'   (reviewIfPending, cancelIfPending, cancelIfApprovedNotStarted, finishIfApprovedStarted, finishElapsedRequestsByIds),
'   service/AreaService.java (cancelRequestsBySystem) · Generated from main @ e474968
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam stateStartColor #000000
skinparam stateEndColor #000000
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateFontColor #0F172A
skinparam stateArrowColor #2563EB
hide empty description

title SM-01 Access Request Lifecycle

state PENDING : awaiting review
state APPROVED : grants entry inside the window
state REJECTED
state CANCELLED
state EXPIRED
state FINISHED

[*] --> PENDING : Authorized User creates request\n[area not Public, valid window, no overlap]

PENDING --> APPROVED : Facility Manager approves\n[now < startTime, reviewer is not requester,\nmembers re-checked, conditional UPDATE hits 1 row]
PENDING --> REJECTED : Facility Manager rejects\n[now < startTime, reason,\nconditional UPDATE hits 1 row]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Requester cancels\n[conditional UPDATE hits 1 row] / source USER
PENDING --> EXPIRED : System job every 15 min\n[startTime passed]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : System\n[area changed to Public or deactivated,\nrequester deactivated or deleted] / source SYSTEM

APPROVED --> FINISHED : Facility Manager finishes\n[now >= startTime, reason]
APPROVED --> FINISHED : System job every 15 min\n[endTime <= now] / no notification
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : Facility Manager cancels\n[now < startTime, reason] / source STAFF
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : System\n[new area type breaks the rules, area deactivated,\nrequester deactivated or deleted; endTime > now] / source SYSTEM

REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
FINISHED --> [*]

note right of APPROVED
  Entry is granted only while
  startTime <= now < endTime (checkEntry).
  A transition out of PENDING is one
  UPDATE ... WHERE status = 'PENDING';
  0 rows -> 409, no notification.
end note
@enduml
